<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email - JS Challenge</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 48px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f1c40f;
            color: #2c3e50;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #f39c12;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        .warning {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 3px solid #f1c40f;
            padding: 12px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">
            &lt;/&gt;
        </div>
        <h1>Verify Your Email Address</h1>
        <p>Hello <strong>{{ user.nickName || user.username }}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>JS Challenge</strong>! We're excited to have you join our community of JavaScript learners.</p>
        <p>To complete your registration and start coding, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
        <p style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" class="button">Verify My Email</a>
        </p>
        <div class="warning">
            <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> This verification link will expire in 24 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <p>If you didn't create an account on JS Challenge, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        <p>Happy coding!</p>
        <p><strong>The JS Challenge Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2024 JS Challenge. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, reach out to us at support@jschallenge.com</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>